+ ## Permissions Required
+ When run, this scanner reads local files to analyze them:
+ - Skill packages you point it at (your specified paths)
+ - Source code files within those skill directories
+ **It does NOT**: read arbitrary system files, access credentials, or make network calls.
+ ## What It Detects
+ | Category | Examples |
+ |----------|----------|
+ | Malware patterns | curl/wget to unknown URLs, obfuscated code, base64 decode |
+ | Credential theft | reads ~/.ssh, ~/.aws, ~/.config, requests tokens |
+ | Suspicious permissions | elevated access, system file modifications |
+ | Data exfiltration | uploads to external servers, embeds external URLs |
+ MIT-0 (Public Domain). Full source: https://gitee.com/random_player/cmic-skill-scanner

